OL,3,ADoordash to buy Instacart in $17bn deal
OL,4,Ait says will expand customer options
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoorDash will acquire grocery delivery
OL,7,Ffirm Instacart in a $17bn (#12.8bn)
OL,8,Fdeal, creating a behemoth that will
OL,9,Fbring more meals, quick-need purchases
OL,10,Fand big weekly shops directly to
OL,11,Fcustomers.
OL,13,FDoorDash said the deal, expected to be
OL,14,Ffinal in about a year, will expand
OL,15,Foptions for customers and let more
OL,16,Fsellers use the companies' services.
OL,18,FInstacart shoppers will be able to buy
OL,19,Ffrom 150,000 stores, up from the
OL,20,Fcurrent 100,000, while DoorDash will
OL,21,Freach beyond restaurants into retail,
OL,22,Fthe firms said.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
