OL,3,ADoordash to buy Instacart in $17bn deal
OL,4,Ait says will expand customer options
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Together, we can accelerate innovation
OL,7,Facross the grocery industry and make
OL,8,Fonline grocery more seamless and
OL,9,Faffordable for the millions of
OL,10,Fhouseholds we serve," Instacart's chief
OL,11,Fexecutive said.
